{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/fa13ff09e7146780af89da9a16758923.avif?t=1751013599\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>'Blind Simulator' </strong>is a unique VR simulation game that lets you experience the world through the eyes of someone who is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You begin the game without vision, relying solely on a white cane to navigate your surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tapping the cane on the ground triggers a sonar-like effect, briefly revealing the shapes and objects in the nearby environment through visual echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.poster.webp?t=1751013599\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.webp?t=1751013599\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a safe and immersive virtual world, you\u2019ll journey toward a hospital by taking buses or subways, crossing busy streets, and exploring unfamiliar locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through this experience, players will learn how to perceive and interpret the unseen using senses beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just a simulation, Blind Simulator delivers a powerful narrative that conveys the daily challenges and fears faced by people with visual impairments. It\u2019s an emotionally resonant VR experience with educational value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey of discovering how to <strong>\u201csee without seeing\u201d</strong> through sound, vibration, and spatial awareness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813130?t=1751013599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/88bf33135b428db2a97e6987f1da0f3337ce4ad5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751013599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/eb1c391cb806d503110139ebe9453a09955c675d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751013599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/eb1c391cb806d503110139ebe9453a09955c675d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751013599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/fa13ff09e7146780af89da9a16758923.avif?t=1751013599\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>'Blind Simulator' </strong>is a unique VR simulation game that lets you experience the world through the eyes of someone who is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You begin the game without vision, relying solely on a white cane to navigate your surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tapping the cane on the ground triggers a sonar-like effect, briefly revealing the shapes and objects in the nearby environment through visual echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.poster.webp?t=1751013599\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.webp?t=1751013599\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a safe and immersive virtual world, you\u2019ll journey toward a hospital by taking buses or subways, crossing busy streets, and exploring unfamiliar locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through this experience, players will learn how to perceive and interpret the unseen using senses beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just a simulation, Blind Simulator delivers a powerful narrative that conveys the daily challenges and fears faced by people with visual impairments. It\u2019s an emotionally resonant VR experience with educational value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey of discovering how to <strong>\u201csee without seeing\u201d</strong> through sound, vibration, and spatial awareness.</p>","developers":["Pathfinder"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/f564a4db42a27dc471efb1fa1c3f6269897d47c2/header.jpg?t=1751013599","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156140,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamsta